  "description": "Crows like shiny things, and Seong Seol-ah likes beautiful things. And the boy next door, Kwon Do-an, happens to have something insanely beautiful. How did she find that out, you ask…? “Can we do it without this? It keeps poking me…” “That’s my X.” Trying to practice self-defense with Do-an, Seol-ah ended up grabbing there. Tightly. Very tightly. “Who accidentally plays around with someone else’s X like that?” Seol-ah, completely pale, desperately tried to smooth over the situation. “Y-You… want to touch mine too?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13088778), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/hard_neighbor), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ddak_ddak), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000073805), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343002937), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69685661) \n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/the-stiff-national-athlete-next-door/list?title_no=9118)",
